.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Builds the Huckel secular matrix for butadiene and benzene (~chemistrykit.quantum.systems.huckel.HuckelSystem), diagonalizes it via numpy.linalg.eigh (a genuine eigenvalue problem, not a lookup table), cross-checks the result against the closed-form Coulson/Frost eigenvalue formulas, and checks Huckel&#x27;s 4n+2 rule (~chemistrykit.quantum.systems.huckel.is_aromatic_by_huckel_rule) against the computed spectrum&#x27;s degeneracies.">

